  <item>
    <title>EP20 女性为什么会有谈钱羞耻感，让我们大胆谈钱吧</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/682a00b2fcbc2e206b8a2b5b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">682a00b2fcbc2e206b8a2b5b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 18 May 2025 15:49:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>闺蜜们，好久不见！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们停更了一个多月，这一个月发生了很多事情，最重要的是Iris结束了Gap Year，又重新加入了我们搞钱女孩的行列！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>“钱、搞钱”似乎对于女生是一件很难公开讲的事情。为什么女生谈钱很难启齿？</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近热播的电视剧《亲爱的仇敌》，给了我们不少启发，</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期我们就来好好聊一聊！</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>附上收听指南</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a>谈钱=拜金？ 谈钱不体面？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a>过生日，能说自己想要一个铂金包作为礼物吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a> “你是独立女性，就不能谈你爱钱吗？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 要，就大胆说出来！正视自己的欲望！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 经济独立才能有自由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a> 女生掌握家里的“经济大权”很重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a> 一定不要放弃培养自己赚钱、理财的能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">13:40</a>上一辈人比我们更大胆谈钱！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a> 结婚前，金钱观是否匹配很重要！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="933">15:33</a> tips1: 恋爱时，用“花钱的上限”来看金钱观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1255">20:55</a> tips2: 婚前长途旅行可以看双方的金钱观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1340">22:20</a> “金钱观”不评价好坏，只看双方是否match</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1450">24:10</a> 职场谈金钱，女生一定要有“配得感”！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1720">28:40</a> 不配得感，会带来内耗和怨气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 我们大胆谈钱，但也不唯钱论！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65d2d1777c83a7c6dab2ba3e/lptlwa_EV2owgQFhrOwRr6GCE7dh.m4a" length="34799601" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:35:51</itunes:duration>
